          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice O'Connor, justice O\u2019Connor asked if there was probable cause for the arrest of all three occupants."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "771567f1beb98787beb477cf982ff7f967b0fdc9151f5e6eda5951915c40b989",
